preserved.","nextNodeIds":[790510102]},{"nodeId":790510102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13150,"speakerName":"Read","textMapHash":3748405898,"text":"Whew... now that's a relief!","nextNodeIds":[790510103]},{"nodeId":790510103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13150,"speakerName":"Read","textMapHash":225205258,"text":"He untangled the knot in his heart, and improved his painting skills! Paimon thinks he'll definitely be really successful.","nextNodeIds":[790510104]},{"nodeId":790510104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13150,"speakerName":"Read","textMapHash":38253354,"text":"Though he left his Water Droplet friends behind, which sounds a bit sad to Paimon.","nextNodeIds":[790510105,790510106]},{"nodeId":790510105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1677661146,"text":"Not all artists can accept imitations.","nextNodeIds":[790510107]},{"nodeId":790510107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13150,"speakerName":"Read","textMapHash":505877090,"text":"Hmm, Paimon can understand that.","nextNodeIds":[790510108]},{"nodeId":790510108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13150,"speakerName":"Read","textMapHash":3106018714,"text":"There's still something that confuses Paimon. He mentioned in the diary that the mural can lose its shape and shift.","nextNodeIds":[790510109]},{"nodeId":790510109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13150,"speakerName":"Read","textMapHash":3801683634,"text":"But even after such a serious accident... the mural seems alright?","nextNodeIds":[790510110,790510111]},{"nodeId":790510110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1846330410,"text":"It's these Water Droplets.","nextNodeIds":[790510112]},{"nodeId":790510112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13150,"speakerName":"Read","textMapHash":3440706714,"text":"Ooh, that's right! No wonder the Water Droplets are so familiar with the Streaming Projector and restoring the mural...","nextNodeIds":[790510113]},{"nodeId":790510113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13150,"speakerName":"Read","textMapHash":166113138,"text":"It's so moving... Water Droplets may not look that bright, but they are really considerate and loyal friends...","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":790510111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2705571090,"text":"They protected their friend's mural.","nextNodeIds":[790510112]},{"nodeId":790510106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3539725402,"text":"Insisting on one's own uniqueness makes sense.","nextNodeIds":[790510107]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7905101,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["7904801","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_INC_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}},{"subQuestId":7905102,"order":2,"stepDescription":"","stepDescTextMapHash":0,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7905102,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"},"isHi